#, python-format
msgid "Hello! To link your account:\\n1. Open Alliance Auth -> Discord-Telegram Bridge\\n2. Click \"Link Account\"\\n3. Enter your Telegram username: @%(username)s\\n4. Click Link - you will receive an invite to the alliance Telegram group(s)\\n\\nI will send a confirmation here once it is done."
